Now I understand the structure. Let me add the `delete` method to `NoteStore`, following the existing style.

```forge_action
{"tool": "write_file", "args": {"path": "notes/storage.py", "edits": [{"search": "    def list(self):
        return self._load()", "replace": "    def list(self):
        return self._load()

    def delete(self, note_id):
        notes = self._load()
        notes = [n for n in notes if n["id"] != note_id]
        self._save(notes)
        return any(n["id"] == note_id for n in notes)
"}]}}
